      <marc:subfield code="a">Fascinating fictional retelling of the events that led to the tragedy of the Titanic, based on documents from the National Archives. A boy works in the dockyard where the Titanic is being built, then gets a job on the ship. As he witnesses a series of mistakes, short-cuts and bad decisions, he becomes more and more worried about what could happen. But he&apos;s preoccupied by his rivalry with a fellow ship&apos;s boy and doesn&apos;t realise the full scale of what&apos;s happening until it&apos;s too late.</marc:subfield>
